    <summary>A highly customizable fan controlling software for Windows.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Fan Control is a focused, highly customizable fan controlling software for Windows. It aggregates
temperature sources from your motherboard, CPU and GPU and lets you drive case, CPU and GPU fans
from custom curves.

### Features

* **Custom fan curves** — linear, graph, target temperature, mix and trigger curves.
* **Broad hardware support** — motherboards, NVIDIA and AMD graphics cards and dedicated sensors
  (backend is based on [LibreHardwareMonitor](https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor)).
* **Profiles** — save and switch configurations per use case (idle vs. gaming).
* **Plugin system** — extend sensor and control support via community plugins.
* **Lightweight** — very low CPU and memory footprint.

### Notes

* This package downloads the official installer from the vendor's GitHub release page.
  The software is **not** redistributed by this package.
* Fan Control is proprietary freeware, licensed for personal, non-commercial use.
  See the [license](https://github.com/Rem0o/FanControl.Releases/blob/master/LICENSE).
* Requires a 64-bit Windows 10 or 11 installation.
* This package installs the .NET 10 build. Users who need the legacy .NET Framework 4.8 build
  should install it manually from the release page.

### Package Parameters

None.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Rem0o/FanControl.Releases/releases/tag/V274</releaseNotes>

